  <title>Building Arcadia</title>

  <meta property="og:title" content="Building Arcadia">
  <meta property="og:description" content="How to build Project Arcadia from source under Windows 11 and Visual Studio Community 2022, and under Linux.">
  <meta name="description" content="How to build Project Arcadia from source under Windows 11 and Visual Studio Community 2022, and under Linux.">
  <meta name="author" content="@{siteAuthor}">
</head>
<body class="my-content-page-1">
  <header>
    <div class="navigation breadcrumbs">
